id: pm-hcrmye
title: "10k scale gate regression: CLI create latency and create/claim peak RSS exceed fixed budgets"
description: The deterministic 10k scale gate fails on current main under Node 26 because CLI create exceeds its latency ceiling and CLI create/claim exceed peak-memory ceilings; product p95 and token budgets still pass.
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 1
tags[5]: "area:cli","area:performance","area:sdk",regression,scale
created_at: "2026-07-24T12:02:38.401Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-24T13:35:07.772Z"
author: claude-code-agent
estimated_minutes: 240
acceptance_criteria: "The unmodified 10k scale gate passes at least three consecutive runs on the supported Node baseline; cli.create best/min is at or below 310 ms; cli.create peak RSS is at or below 115184640 bytes and cli.claim peak RSS is at or below 118031360 bytes; no budget increase, exclusion, iteration reduction, or feature loss; SDK and CLI correctness/token checks remain green; before/after phase and allocation evidence identifies the cause."
parent: pm-9rxu
risk: high
confidence: high
severity: high
expected_result: "pnpm benchmark:scale:check passes the committed latency, RSS, correctness, and token budgets without budget relaxation."
actual_result: Current main fails cli.create latency plus cli.create and cli.claim peak RSS ceilings while all other reported product budgets pass.
component: performance
regression: true
comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-24T12:02:38.401Z",claude-code-agent,"Duplicate-check evidence: all-status search over scale, create, claim, RSS, memory, and benchmark terms found the closed harness pm-mi2x and the living scale epic pm-9rxu, but no open item owning this current fixed-budget regression. Filed as a focused child of pm-9rxu."
  "2026-07-24T12:40:37.906Z",codex-root-agent,"Implementation start: claimed as an actively worked part of the broad SDK workspace mutation integrity PR. TDD scope covers deterministic id allocation, atomic stale-lock takeover, init cache and merge-fence ownership, schema migration idempotency/recovery, cross-runtime machine channels, and the fixed 10k performance gate."
  "2026-07-24T13:04:03.722Z",codex-root-agent,"Evidence update: unmodified Node 26 gate remains red after application optimizations (create best 376ms and 140640256 RSS; claim 138436608 RSS). Node 22 after removing redundant pre-lock probes improved create best from 345ms to 320ms and both RSS ceilings pass, but latency remains 10ms over the fixed gate. Budgets remain untouched; item stays active pending a real startup optimization."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-24T12:06:04.040Z",claude-code-agent,"Reproduction environment: current main at d96dfc85, pm 2026.7.24-3, Node v26.5.0, pnpm 11.10.0. The gate failure is evidence of budget drift, not permission to change scripts/bench/scale-budgets.json. Reproduce across supported Node versions before attributing the regression solely to application code."
